{"id":"f618199ac5db3f36","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-ultrafilter-principal.md","title":"Ultrafilter Principal Test","display":"thm-ultrafilter-principal — Ultrafilter Principal Test","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ultrafilter-principal","aliases":["58-thm-ultrafilter-principal"],"display":"thm-ultrafilter-principal — Ultrafilter Principal Test","depends_on":["[[./58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-principal-filter.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ultrafilter-principal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ultrafilter-principal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ultrafilter-principal — Ultrafilter Principal Test"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"./58-df-ultrafilter.md\">58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce1994feba7202d5\" href=\"?note=ce1994feba7202d5\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-principal-filter.md\">../batch04/58-df-principal-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,U,a\\in V\">\\(A,U,a\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"./58-df-ultrafilter.md\">58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ce1994feba7202d5\" href=\"?note=ce1994feba7202d5\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-principal-filter.md\">../batch04/58-df-principal-filter.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}principal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\n\\to\n\\exists a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}(U,a,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}principal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\n\\to\n\\exists a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}(U,a,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}(U,a,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}(U,a,A)\\)</span> 是三元谓词，不是返回滤子对象的二元函数。</li>\n<li>有限底集上的每个超滤都是主超滤；若底集无限，则一般不能删除有限性前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","